{"title":"2013 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2dc75cd834e80593377e4ec84188c607f6c47d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^2 + 6^2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"41\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d0238c60ba79e66526d038b6b2ea3df983c449c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 86 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 34 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 68 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/860b744b35a7ffc5ce24ca70632ff19aeeae30b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^2 + 6^2}{2} = \\frac{100 + 36}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"166\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/2/4f256ab5bb1bd7df47c7ec41b235e1949a55a92c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{136}{2} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 68}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"142\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td styl